WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step into a low lunge with hands framing the front foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Drop the back knee if needed.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rotate, reaching one arm to the sky.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Optionally straighten the front leg for a hamstring moment.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Flow to the other side.
